{
  "text": " Exercise 131, Contrasting Descriptive and Set Phrases. Repeat after me. 1. It's a short nail. It's a fingernail. 2. It's a chocolate cake. It's a pancake. 3. It's a hot bath. It's a hot tub. 4. It's a long drive. It's a hard drive. 5. It's the back door. It's the backbone. 6. There are four cards. It's a card trick. 7. It's a small spot. It's a spotlight. 8. It's a good book. It's a phone book. Pause the CD and rewrite your descriptive phrases, exercise 125, and set phrases, exercise 128. Thank you.",
